From 54e4a08ab9f3521e2de4b187e66e820311d7fde2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: well0nez <8986239+well0nez@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 19:44:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 88/88] configs: h713: the HY310 powers off through crust too

Measured on a HY310 over FEL on 10.10.2026 (doku/190): the power off ends
in phase 7, step 0x613, the rails low. The 60 s test build woke by itself
after 60062 ms, the power key woke after 111 s and the IR remote after
5 s, each through the R_WDOG reset into a warm start (GP5 RUN1). Its
release build gets CONFIG_H713_POWER_OFF like the HY200 QZ713DF A1
(baef011).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/h713_hy310_sr_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/h713_hy310_sr_defconfig b/configs/h713_hy310_sr_defconfig
index 6cff7ae..4e6880a 100644
--- a/configs/h713_hy310_sr_defconfig
+++ b/configs/h713_hy310_sr_defconfig
@@ -11,3 +11,4 @@ CONFIG_H713_DRAM_SELF_REFRESH=y
 CONFIG_H713_BOARD_ID=1
 CONFIG_H713_LED_RED_PIN=0
 CONFIG_H713_LED_BLUE_PIN=1
+CONFIG_H713_POWER_OFF=y
